DS Cookie Consent - third-party data notice
===========================================

data/known-cookies.json is a curated cookie database maintained by D-Solutions
(overlay file: tools/build-known-db/overlay-services.json). Cookie names,
durations and purposes were checked against the Open Cookie Database and
against vendor documentation.

